OL,3,ACrew unaware of risks before Bayesian
OL,4,Ayacht accident, say investigators
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe crew of the Bayesian superyacht did
OL,7,Fnot know about a critical safety risk
OL,8,Fthat left it vulnerable in powerful
OL,9,Fwinds before it sank off the coast in
OL,10,Fnorthern Sicily coast, killing seven
OL,11,Fpeople, British investigators say.
OL,13,FBritish tech tycoon Mike Lynch, 59, and
OL,14,Fhis daughter Hannah, 18, were among
OL,15,Fseven people who died when the vessel
OL,16,Fsank on 19 August 2024.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
